WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:11.065
"The slime hand got June!" Pip cries.

2
00:00:11.066 --> 00:00:25.935
A flash of light shines from the game.

3
00:00:25.936 --> 00:00:31.258
It sucks in the kids.

4
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.791
"Ahh!" they cry.

5
00:00:35.792 --> 00:00:39.249
Then the bright light fades.

6
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:44.611
The kids drop from the sky.

7
00:00:44.612 --> 00:01:00.035
Splat! They land in a sticky spot.

8
00:01:00.036 --> 00:01:06.910
"Oh no! It's slime!" Jane says.

9
00:01:06.911 --> 00:01:22.817
Pip checks the sticky stuff. "No, it's jelly.

10
00:01:22.818 --> 00:01:26.296
Sweet Land is sweet.

11
00:01:26.297 --> 00:01:31.583
But . . . where is June?"

12
00:01:31.584 --> 00:01:33.938
Jane rubs her chin.

13
00:01:33.939 --> 00:01:37.793
"Let's try to find her."

14
00:01:37.795 --> 00:01:42.443
The kids walk in long grass.

15
00:01:42.444 --> 00:01:49.189
"This grass looks like candy," Pip says.

16
00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:53.874
"And the hills look like pies."

17
00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:58.750
He picks some grass and chomps on it.

18
00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:01.116
"Yummy!"

19
00:02:01.117 --> 00:02:05.437
"Yuck." Jane makes a face.

20
00:02:05.438 --> 00:02:10.539
Pip grins. "Try it."

21
00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:18.090
"No, thanks," Jane says.

22
00:02:18.091 --> 00:02:21.106
"I don't see slime here.

23
00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:23.605
Was June right?"

24
00:02:23.606 --> 00:02:28.006
"I don't think she lied," Pip says.

25
00:02:28.007 --> 00:02:32.328
Just then he stops and bends down.

26
00:02:32.329 --> 00:02:36.596
Jane sighs. "Don't eat the grass."

27
00:02:36.597 --> 00:02:45.315
"I'm not," Pip says. "I see June's wand!"

28
00:02:45.316 --> 00:02:54.472
Jane gasps. "Why is it there?"

